function overlap(a0,a1,b0,b1){return a0<=b1&&b0<=a1} export function compileGeoTemporalQuery(q={}){const start=q.startAt?Number(new Date(q.startAt)):-Infinity,end=q.endAt?Number(new Date(q.endAt)):Infinity;if(start>end)throw new Error('QUERY_TIME_RANGE_INVALID');const bbox=q.bbox;if(bbox&&(!Array.isArray(bbox)||bbox.length!==4||bbox[0]>bbox[2]||bbox[1]>bbox[3]))throw new Error('QUERY_BBOX_INVALID');return {start,end,bbox:bbox||null,types:new Set(q.types||[]),truth:new Set(q.truthClasses||[]),limit:Math.min(500,Math.max(1,Number(q.limit||100)))}}
export function runGeoTemporalQuery(records=[],q={}){const c=compileGeoTemporalQuery(q);return records.filter(r=>{const t=Number(new Date(r.occurredAt??r.observedAt??r.publishedAt??0));if(Number.isFinite(t)&&!overlap(t,t,c.start,c.end))return false;if(c.types.size&&!c.types.has(r.type))return false;if(c.truth.size&&!c.truth.has(r.truthClass))return false;if(c.bbox){const [w,s,e,n]=c.bbox;const lon=Number(r.lon),lat=Number(r.lat);if(!Number.isFinite(lon)||!Number.isFinite(lat)||lon<w||lon>e||lat<s||lat>n)return false}return true}).sort((a,b)=>Number(new Date(b.occurredAt??b.observedAt??0))-Number(new Date(a.occurredAt??a.observedAt??0))).slice(0,c.limit)}
